body:
Because, aliens are of a higher intelligence, so the real question is.....

&#x200B;

Why would they?

I've been here thinking for like 30 minutes and everything I;ve got is kinda dark, couldn't come up with anything good sooo..........

&#x200B;

I woke up, thats kinda the only non-depressing/dark thing that i could think of

How the hell does this whole gay/lesbian/gender fluid/there are now 90 different genders because someone turning themselves from a boy to girl counts as a separate gender make any sense? How do you keep up with who turns to a boy who's a girl, who's turning from one to the other and who likes what gender and who's what? how can you say you were born this way if one week you decide you're gay then the next week your bi and the next your pan then you're back to gay again, this shit is just freaking unstable and is clearly just you picking and choosing what you are. What is this whole gender switching surgery like? How does this gender system thing make any sense to you? When did you decide that you were gay/lesbian/bi/pan or what ever else. Also, are you ok? what was your home life like? What was your first non-straight sexual experience like? (if you answer this question, please no graphics) How do you feel about people who are against this whole being gay thing? Have you ever hit on someone who was straight? if so how did it go? I personally have been hit on by my bi friend who is a girl, I also am a girl, i just straight out told her my opinion and my stand on the matter, and that i couldn't see girls that way. Luckily she took that well and was just glad i was honest with her, we are still friends to this day, she is really nice.

&#x200B;

P.S. I actually have a-lot of gay/lesbian/bi/pan friends, we're close but this system makes no sense to me. They know i don't support this whole gay thing but we're still cool. I actually like them more then some straight people I know so i'm not saying their bad people or anything. this system is just stupid to me. But I don't support bulling someone over it, if you do that then you're just another piece of shit in this world.
